  "description": "Roslyn C# language server adapter for Claude Code and other agents. Runs as an LSP server (`claude-roslyn-lsp lsp`) that mediates Microsoft's roslyn-language-server so navigation and edit-time diagnostics work reliably, and as an MCP server (`claude-roslyn-lsp mcp`) that exposes semantic refactoring - rename, code actions, fix-all, formatting and on-demand diagnostics - to models that would otherwise reach for grep and sed. Pure BCL, Native AOT, no compiler packages of its own.",
